<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><kml xmlns="http://www.opengis.net/kml/2.2"><Document><name>Hyderabad road trip shortlist</name><Placemark><name>Shri Jagannatha Temple</name><description>Optional city sightseeing. Group with nearby places to reduce cross-city driving. Source: https://www.openstreetmap.org/node/4432377892</description><Point><coordinates>78.4259266,17.4150026,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Cafe Niloufer</name><description>Multiple branches. Map shows the Banjara Hills branch; choose the branch you want before driving. Photo may show a different branch. Source: https://www.openstreetmap.org/node/11771783710</description><Point><coordinates>78.4277314,17.413327,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>KBR Park</name><description>Best easy green break near your base. Walk for 60–90 minutes; stay on designated visitor paths. Urban surroundings, so clean air is not guaranteed. Source: https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/28268610</description><Point><coordinates>78.4205231,17.4201773,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Hussain Sagar Lake</name><description>Lakefront sightseeing rather than an escape from urban traffic; combine with nearby landmarks in one outing. Source: https://www.openstreetmap.org/relation/2833155</description><Point><coordinates>78.475421,17.4229113,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Buddha Statue</name><description>Island landmark. Reaching it depends on the authorised boat service and conditions; allow extra time. Source: https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/211408794</description><Point><coordinates>78.475113,17.415557,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Ambedkar Statue</name><description>Mapped to the large statue beside the Secretariat, not other local Ambedkar statues. Source: https://www.openstreetmap.org/</description><Point><coordinates>78.4673984,17.4132697,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Birla Mandir</name><description>Optional city sightseeing. Group with nearby places to reduce cross-city driving. Source: https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/318505362</description><Point><coordinates>78.4692594,17.4056977,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Prasads Multiplex</name><description>Optional city sightseeing. Group with nearby places to reduce cross-city driving. Source: https://www.openstreetmap.org/node/10789496134</description><Point><coordinates>78.4657508,17.4127019,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Telangana Martyrs Memorial</name><description>Assumed to mean the newer memorial beside the Secretariat/Hussain Sagar, not the older Gun Park memorial. Source: https://www.openstreetmap.org/</description><Point><coordinates>78.4729835,17.4086623,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Snow World</name><description>Optional city sightseeing. Group with nearby places to reduce cross-city driving. Source: https://www.openstreetmap.org/node/726751707</description><Point><coordinates>78.4808321,17.4143801,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>NTR Gardens</name><description>Optional city sightseeing. Group with nearby places to reduce cross-city driving. Source: https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/29124126</description><Point><coordinates>78.4688385,17.4125106,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Lumbini Park</name><description>Optional city sightseeing. Group with nearby places to reduce cross-city driving. Source: https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/29124134</description><Point><coordinates>78.4728234,17.4097139,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Charminar</name><description>Optional city sightseeing. Group with nearby places to reduce cross-city driving. Source: https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/238186115</description><Point><coordinates>78.4746421,17.3616024,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Ramoji Film City</name><description>A full-day entertainment choice. It would replace your nature day, not fit as a quick scenic stop. Source: https://www.openstreetmap.org/relation/19917367</description><Point><coordinates>78.6798167,17.2521371,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Sudha Cars Museum</name><description>Optional city sightseeing. Group with nearby places to reduce cross-city driving. Source: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sudha_Cars_Museum</description><Point><coordinates>78.4544072,17.3569907,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Purani Haveli</name><description>Optional city sightseeing. Group with nearby places to reduce cross-city driving. Source: https://www.openstreetmap.org/node/2948168574</description><Point><coordinates>78.4805382,17.3663487,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Chowmahalla Palace</name><description>Optional city sightseeing. Group with nearby places to reduce cross-city driving. Source: https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/116031164</description><Point><coordinates>78.4717055,17.3575817,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Qutb Shahi Tombs</name><description>Optional city sightseeing. Group with nearby places to reduce cross-city driving. Source: https://www.openstreetmap.org/node/4683200894</description><Point><coordinates>78.4001622,17.3973713,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Golconda Fort</name><description>Optional city sightseeing. Group with nearby places to reduce cross-city driving. Source: https://www.openstreetmap.org/relation/9128913</description><Point><coordinates>78.4010991,17.3833665,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Statue of Equality</name><description>Optional city sightseeing. Group with nearby places to reduce cross-city driving. Source: https://www.openstreetmap.org/node/9468082609</description><Point><coordinates>78.3331589,17.1858042,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Bansilalpet Stepwell</name><description>Optional city sightseeing. Group with nearby places to reduce cross-city driving. Source: https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Category:Bansilalpet_Stepwell</description><Point><coordinates>78.493153,17.430613,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Bhongir Fort</name><description>Best fit on the onward Warangal drive. Allow 1.5–2.5 hours for the climb and views. Exposed and strenuous compared with a park; visit early. Source: https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/244004785</description><Point><coordinates>78.8924004,17.5148934,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Ananthagiri Hills</name><description>Top overall choice: forest scenery, permitted trails, birdwatching and Anantha Padmanabha Swamy temple. Allow a full day with Kotepally. Go on the weekday if one of your two days is a weekday. Source: https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/177760375</description><Point><coordinates>77.8618594,17.322833,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Kotepally Reservoir</name><description>Pair with Ananthagiri. Sit by an accessible shore, take photos, and kayak only if an authorised operator is running with life jackets. Pin is the reservoir, not a parking entrance. Source: https://www.fishangler.com/fishing-waters/in/telangana/kotepally-reservoir/36334893</description><Point><coordinates>77.750325,17.364934,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Rachakonda Fort</name><description>Alternative to the west nature day if you prefer rocky ruins and hiking. Rural approach; park where locally permitted and walk. Do not combine with Ananthagiri on the same day. Source: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rachakonda_Fort</description><Point><coordinates>78.8025,17.18222222,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Khajaguda Hills</name><description>Nearby rocky scenery, but access has been restricted at times. Confirm the permitted entrance before planning a visit; never bypass fencing. Source: https://in.atozbrowse.com/listingspage.php?data=18119</description><Point><coordinates>78.3661,17.4125,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Koheda Hills</name><description>Pin is a published photo viewpoint, not a verified visitor entrance. Lower-priority exposed hill outing; verify safe legal access. Source: https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Koheda_Hills.jpg</description><Point><coordinates>78.65625,17.289575,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Oxygen Park Kandlakoya</name><description>Assumed to mean Kandlakoya Oxygen Park. Woodland walk, but north of your base and not a priority over nearby green spaces. Source: https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/1233783922</description><Point><coordinates>78.4928737,17.6043089,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Ammapalli Stepwell</name><description>Temple-area reference pin. The restoration organisation lists the stepwell project as ongoing; confirm public access separately. Better as a south-side heritage outing than a Warangal-route stop. Source: https://darshansaathi.com/temples/sri-seetha-ramachandra-swamy-temple-ammapalli</description><Point><coordinates>78.3453,17.2572,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Kondapochamma Reservoir</name><description>Separate northern detour, with limited shade and access that needs checking. Lower priority for this two-day plan. Source: https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q97253327</description><Point><coordinates>78.686944,17.743889,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Himayat Sagar</name><description>Optional city sightseeing. Group with nearby places to reduce cross-city driving. Source: https://www.openstreetmap.org/node/7246595608</description><Point><coordinates>78.3642953,17.3312158,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Ocean Park</name><description>Water/amusement park; lower fit for a quiet nature trip. Source: https://mapcarta.com/W544177153</description><Point><coordinates>78.32894,17.38979,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Botanical Garden</name><description>Good relaxed city alternative for a shaded morning walk. Choose this OR KBR if you want a slow day. Source: https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/29124485</description><Point><coordinates>78.3572318,17.4547715,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Errum Manzil Palace</name><description>Do not assume tourist entry: confirm access before making a special trip. Source: https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/361409838</description><Point><coordinates>78.4548038,17.4194744,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Sanjeevaiah Childrens Park</name><description>Mapped as Sanjeevaiah Park on the north shore. Confirm current admission rules, especially if travelling without children. Source: https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/29124107</description><Point><coordinates>78.4758019,17.4320069,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Nehru Zoological Park</name><description>Optional city sightseeing. Group with nearby places to reduce cross-city driving. Source: https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/27937605</description><Point><coordinates>78.4455598,17.3514419,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Salar Jung Museum</name><description>Optional city sightseeing. Group with nearby places to reduce cross-city driving. Source: https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/238284090</description><Point><coordinates>78.4801498,17.371392,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Swarnagiri Temple</name><description>Temple at Manepally Hills near Bhuvanagiri, located using the map embedded on its own website. Optional on the onward journey, with potential queues; not a top quiet-nature choice. Source: https://www.swarnagiritemple.com/</description><Point><coordinates>78.8513799,17.4942336,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Nampally exhibition Numaish</name><description>Seasonal event, not a year-round attraction. Official 2026 dates were Jan 1–Feb 15; check the organiser for your actual travel dates. Source: https://www.openstreetmap.org/node/626940817</description><Point><coordinates>78.4704712,17.38675,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Chirala</name><description>Separate coastal trip in Andhra Pradesh. Pin marks the town, not a beach. Skip on this Hyderabad–Warangal itinerary. Source: https://www.openstreetmap.org/node/2332853825</description><Point><coordinates>80.3543618,15.8309139,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Shaikpet base area</name><description>AREA ONLY: Mashallah Apartment exact address was not verified. Replace the origin with your apartment pin for navigation. Source: https://www.openstreetmap.org/</description><Point><coordinates>78.4006536,17.4057955,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Bengaluru</name><description>Optional city sightseeing. Group with nearby places to reduce cross-city driving. Source: https://www.openstreetmap.org/relation/7902476</description><Point><coordinates>77.590082,12.9767936,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Warangal</name><description>Optional city sightseeing. Group with nearby places to reduce cross-city driving. Source: https://www.openstreetmap.org/node/2885001475</description><Point><coordinates>79.5970954,17.9820644,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Pakhal Lake</name><description>Extra recommendation after Warangal, about 50 km east. Good for permitted shoreline walks, birdwatching and lake photos. Allow a separate half-day; do not swim or enter sanctuary trails without permission. Source: https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/112553260</description><Point><coordinates>79.9972892,17.9557143,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Laknavaram Lake</name><description>Optional Warangal-side extension for lake scenery, bridge walks and operating boat services. More developed and potentially busier than a quiet shore at Pakhal. Source: https://www.openstreetmap.org/relation/1579478</description><Point><coordinates>80.060325,18.1480174,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark></Document></kml>